@startuml
!theme plain
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
rectangle "IdentityDb\nIdentityService" as ID
rectangle "CustomerVehicleDb\nCustomerVehicleService" as CV
rectangle "QuoteRatingDb\nQuoteRatingService" as QR
database "UnderwritingDb\nUnderwritingService" as UW
database "PolicyBillingDb\nPolicyBillingService" as PB
database "ClaimsDb\nClaimsService" as CL

CV --> ID : IdentityUserId / AgentIdentityUserId
QR --> CV : CustomerId / VehicleId / risk contract
QR --> ID : AgentIdentityUserId
QR --> CL : claim-history contract
UW --> QR : QuoteId / finalized quote context
UW --> CV : CustomerId / VehicleId / context as needed
UW --> ID : UnderwriterIdentityUserId
PB --> UW : UnderwritingApplicationId / approved-offer contract
PB --> CV : CustomerId / VehicleId
CL --> PB : PolicyId / CustomerId / VehicleId / DateOfLoss
CL --> CV : CustomerId / VehicleId / Agent/Adjuster identifiers
CL --> ID : identity identifiers as required

note bottom of ID
Dashed/arrowed links represent API-level identifiers/contracts,
not database relationships or SQL foreign keys.
end note
@enduml
